Name: Bergamot local translation engine
URL: https://github.com/mozilla/translations
Version: v0.6.0 / eea6e5a80aa4ddd86d9cc35ce9a65b79aa3ab96d
License: MPL 2.0
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Source-built CPU inference behind the existing sandboxed utility service.
The owned ABI wrapper is GPL-3.0; support components retain their licences in
notices/. Exact source archive revisions and SHA-256s are in deps.ini and
translation_engine/source-pins.json. Native changes are in
translation_engine/patches/native-sandbox.patch. No engine binary is downloaded.

Released model generation 3.x files are MPL-2.0, as stated by mozilla/translations.
The host embeds a pinned per-file URL, size, raw/decoded hash and licence manifest.
Model files are downloaded only after an explicit host menu action, from the
original Mozilla CDN. No models are bundled, mirrored or published here.
